### 16. CONCEPTS YAAD RAKHO

```
Linear Regression   = Number predict karna
Logistic Regression = Yes/No predict karna
Train               = Model ko sikhana (80%)
Test                = Model ka exam (20%)
RMSE                = Average error (numbers)
Accuracy            = % sahi predictions (Yes/No)
Confusion Matrix    = Sahi/Galat table
X                   = Input (features)
y                   = Output (target)
model.fit()         = Train karo
model.predict()     = Predict karo
random_state=42     = Har baar same split
```

